(N'HADR_DBR_SUBSCRIBER',N'HA_REPLICATION',2,0,N'The publisher for an availability replica event (such as a state change or configuration change) is waiting for exclusive read/write access to the runtime state of an event subscriber that corresponds to an availability database. Internal use only.',N'Availability Groups, Mirroring oder HA-Hintergrundarbeit.',N'Je Wait entweder erwarteter Idle-Zustand oder erhöhte Commit-/Redo-/Send-Latenz.',N'Benign-Flag beachten; Replica-Zustand, Queues, Netzwerk und Log-I/O prüfen.',N'FRAMEWORK_CURATED',N'FRAMEWORK_CURATED'),
