(N'HADR_DB_COMMAND',N'HA_REPLICATION',2,0,N'Waiting for responses to conversational messages (which require an explicit response from the other side, using the AlwaysOn conversational message infrastructure). A number of different message types use this wait type.',N'Availability Groups, Mirroring oder HA-Hintergrundarbeit.',N'Je Wait entweder erwarteter Idle-Zustand oder erhöhte Commit-/Redo-/Send-Latenz.',N'Benign-Flag beachten; Replica-Zustand, Queues, Netzwerk und Log-I/O prüfen.',N'FRAMEWORK_CURATED',N'FRAMEWORK_CURATED'),
(N'HADR_DB_OP_COMPLETION_SYNC',N'HA_REPLICATION',2,0,N'Waiting for responses to conversational messages (which require an explicit response from the other side, using the AlwaysOn conversational message infrastructure). A number of different message types use this wait type.',N'Availability Groups, Mirroring oder HA-Hintergrundarbeit.',N'Je Wait entweder erwarteter Idle-Zustand oder erhöhte Commit-/Redo-/Send-Latenz.',N'Benign-Flag beachten; Replica-Zustand, Queues, Netzwerk und Log-I/O prüfen.',N'FRAMEWORK_CURATED',N'FRAMEWORK_CURATED'),
(N'HADR_DB_OP_START_SYNC',N'HA_REPLICATION',2,0,N'An AlwaysOn DDL statement or a Windows Server Failover Clustering command is waiting for serialized access to an availability database and its runtime state.',N'Availability Groups, Mirroring oder HA-Hintergrundarbeit.',N'Je Wait entweder erwarteter Idle-Zustand oder erhöhte Commit-/Redo-/Send-Latenz.',N'Benign-Flag beachten; Replica-Zustand, Queues, Netzwerk und Log-I/O prüfen.',N'FRAMEWORK_CURATED',N'FRAMEWORK_CURATED'),
(N'HADR_FILESTREAM_BLOCK_FLUSH',N'HA_REPLICATION',2,0,N'The FILESTREAM AlwaysOn transport manager is waiting until processing of a log block is finished.',N'Availability Groups, Mirroring oder HA-Hintergrundarbeit.',N'Je Wait entweder erwarteter Idle-Zustand oder erhöhte Commit-/Redo-/Send-Latenz.',N'Benign-Flag beachten; Replica-Zustand, Queues, Netzwerk und Log-I/O prüfen.',N'FRAMEWORK_CURATED',N'FRAMEWORK_CURATED'),
